  "body": "Tender: Closes on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nImagine waking up to these breathtaking views every day! And believe it or not, a property like this could be yours for somewhere in the $2,000,000s!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 96 Ngataringa Road, perched at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac and boasting breathtaking harbour and city views. By day, watch the ever-changing activity on the water; by night, enjoy the sparkling city lights. The view never disappoints.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 928m² freehold site with riparian rights, this property offers so much. A private staircase even leads down to a waterside platform, perfect for storing your kayaks or taking a dip in the harbour.\r\n\r\nThis 1965 weatherboard home spans over two levels. The best way to describe it is mid century magic - simply cool, stylish and wonderfully liveable. The current owners have carried out extensive renovations and decoration inside and out, leaving nothing to do but move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe main level focuses on relaxed living and those incredible views. A bespoke kitchen, dining area, and lounge are perfectly positioned to maximise the outlook, while a spacious bedroom and bathroom on this floor provide an ideal guest suite or comfortable single-level living, with additional accommodation upstairs for family and friends.\r\n\r\nFrom the living area and bedroom, doors open straight out to stunning outdoor living, with plenty of room for lounge furniture and outdoor dining. It’s the perfect setting for summer entertaining, long lunches, and relaxed barbecues, or cosy evenings by the outdoor fireplace, all with that spectacular harbour backdrop.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs and the views somehow get even better! A second living room offers another fabulous space to relax and unwind, plus three more spacious bedrooms and a recently updated bathroom. A handy kitchenette on this level makes entertaining upstairs easy. A long deck runs along the front of the upstairs rooms, giving you yet another place to sit back, soak up the sunshine and enjoy the outlook.\r\n\r\nRemarkably, almost every room enjoys those wonderful harbour and city views, making this a very special place to come home to.\r\n\r\nIt’s clear a great deal of thought and love went into creating a home that feels stylish and welcoming while staying practical and easy to care for.\r\n\r\nA sweeping driveway leads to a generous incorporated carport, complete with storage cupboards and electric vehicle charging.\r\n\r\nWith views like these, space to entertain, room for family and friends, and even your own access to the water, this is more than just a home — it’s a lifestyle with views and sunsets that you’ll never tire of.",
